description: Fireplace/electric heating controller — pins, 74HC595, 75/55/35 logic
alwaysApply: true
---

This folder is the LCTech ESP32-WROOM-32E 16-ch relay heating firmware. Read AGENTS.md before editing.

Relays are two on-board 74HC595s (GPIO14/13/12/5/4). Never drive pumps/heater/valve from raw ESP32 GPIOs.

Control logic lives in `controlStep()`:
- AUTO uses the pipe directly. Under 35 °C: valve electric, heater ON even with no thermostat, each pump follows its own thermostat. 35–55 °C: fireplace, heater off, both pumps off. Above 55 °C: fireplace, heater off, both pumps on.
- Remote ELECTRIC / FIREPLACE still use the 75/55/35 latches. fireDump overrides those two requests.
- Up to two more DS18B20s share GPIO23. Only the learned pipe address runs this logic. `a=` and `b=` are report-only.
- JC3248W535C remote is `env:remote` (USB-C on the panel). Do not flash it through the C3 bridge. Pins and GUI constraints: `SCREEN.md`.

Serial upload is through the C3 SuperMini at 115200 with no_reset. Do not flash C3 firmware here. Full flash/OTA notes: README.md.
